sets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;121 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;17&lt;br&gt;ACF Country field - Display a select field of all countries, in any language.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nlemoine/page-for-custom-post-type&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;page-for-custom-post-type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;9 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;3&lt;br&gt;WordPress plugin to set a page for any custom post type archive — just like the native &amp;quot;page for posts&amp;quot; setting.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nlemoine/http-cli&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;http-cli&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;2 &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/git-fork.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;git-fork&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;0&lt;br&gt;Serverless HTTP client - make requests to PHP scripts on the command line&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Hi, I&#39;m Nicolas 👋&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Freelance full-stack dev from Rennes 🇫🇷 — WordPress &amp;amp; modern PHP, and a &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/timber/timber&quot;&gt;Timber&lt;/a&gt; maintainer.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;🏢 Projects&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Open-source projects I build and maintain, mostly around WordPress, Timber, PHP, and JavaScript/TypeScript:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h4&gt;WordPress&lt;/h4&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
